  "notes": {
    "Uploading assets": "These are not Markdown syntax. Paste, drop and the file picker copy a file to the asset folder. The suite in test/vscode/suite.cjs tests them in a real VS Code webview.",
    "Disabling Markdown rendering": "This is a button in the GitHub web page, not syntax. In this editor the </> button and the command crazyRichMarkdown.openSource show the raw file."
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "section": "Headings",
      "markdown": "# One\n\n## Two\n\n### Three\n\n#### Four\n\n##### Five\n\n###### Six",
      "expect": {
        "nodes": {
          "heading": 6
        },
        "marks": {},
        "dom": {
          "h1": 1,
          "h2": 1,
          "h3": 1,
          "h4": 1,
          "h5": 1,
          "h6": 1
        }
      },
      "forms": [
        "# ",
        "## ",
        "### ",
        "#### ",
        "##### ",
        "###### "
      ]
    },
    {
      "section": "Styling text",
      "markdown": "**bold** or __bold__, *italic* or _italic_, ~~strike~~, **bold and _nested italic_**, ***all bold and italic***\n\nH<sub>2</sub>O, x<sup>2</sup>, and <ins>underlined</ins>.",
      "expect": {
        "nodes": {},
        "marks": {
          "bold": 5,
          "italic": 4,
          "strike": 1,
          "subscript": 1,
          "superscript": 1,
          "underline": 1
        },
        "dom": {
          "strong": 4,
          "em": 4,
          "s": 1,
          "sub": 1,
          "sup": 1,
          "u": 1
        }
      },
      "forms": [
        "**",
        "__",
        "_",
        "*",
        "~~",
        "***",
        "<sub>",
        "<sup>",
        "<ins>"
      ],
      "roundtrip": "**bold** or **bold**, *italic* or *italic*, ~~strike~~, **bold and *nested italic***, ***all bold and italic***\n\nH<sub>2</sub>O, x<sup>2</sup>, and <ins>underlined</ins>."
    },
    {
