    {
      "section": "Quoting code",
      "markdown": "Use `git status` here.\n\nUse `` `code` `` with backticks.\n\n```\nplain block\n```\n\n```js\nconst a = 1;\n```\n\n````md\n```js\nnested\n```\n````",
